linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

I have a mind, too… I only bear you gratitude
for proving that. This may come somewhat late,
but―thank you very much.

…also, if I had to explain myself to save face,
it's not that my face is frozen with fear;
rather, it's because #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's big mouth defies all logic.
